WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.980
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:10.110
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.380
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.080
Riolu, use Vacuum Wave!

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.210
Force Palm!

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.220
That’s enough!

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.660
All right.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.210
You got in close
at just the right time.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.690
Thank you, too, Pikachu.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.040
Next up, Kamonegi and Kairyu!

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.320
Satoshi!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.200
Go?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.840
Let’s go to Johto!

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:03.960
Johto?

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:15.190
So Miss Saito is
training in Johto?

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:23.310
Satoshi is currently participating in a battling festival
known as the Pokémon World Championships.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:27.980
Saito is a contestant who
previously defeated him.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.780
Learning that she’s in
the Johto Region’s Tamba City,

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:34.140
he’s heading there
hoping for a rematch.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.890
This is great. I’d just been thinking of
catching some Johto Pokémon, myself.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.580
We’d both better give it our all.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.580
Ah, I got one!

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.580
Huh?

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.240
Tamba City, Johto Region

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.050
Here we are!
Tamba Gym!
Tamba City, Johto Region

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.470
Tamba City, Johto Region

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.770
I was so close...

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:01.890
Begin!

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:23.050
Remarkable! You took every last one
of my Nyorobon’s Poison Jabs!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.290
A Championships notification!

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.170
Miss Saito!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:09.890
Overcome Octolock!!
Satoshi VS Saito!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:27.470
That young man looks familiar...

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.620
This is an official
battle announcement.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.910
Would you like to battle? Or not?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.590
Battle me, Miss Saito!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:40.300
Huh? Um...
Do you recognize me?

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:42.300
The Riolu trainer.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.470
Looks like she
doesn’t remember your name.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.600
Huh?!

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.530
Ma’am, you’ve battled him before?

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:54.670
I remember his
Riolu and Kamonegi.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.360
That response is so like you!

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.740
I will accept any challenge
I am given.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.490
Official battle appointment made!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.820
Right!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.070
Otosupus, return for now.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.380
Mr. Shijima, may we use the Gym?

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:22.000
I knew it! You really <i>are</i> Satoshi!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.400
Yes! Long time, no see!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.630
Very well.
Use it however you please!

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.510
Thank you!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.250
You know him?

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.990
I am a Gym Leader.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.230
They say I let my roaring fists
do the talking!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:42.610
I never forget any trainer with whom
I have exchanged roaring fists!

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:46.860
Miss Saito, I made it
back into the Super Class!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:50.080
You had dropped
into the Normal Class?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:54.910
I see. You can only battle trainers
in the same class as you, after all.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.820
Yeah! This’ll be
Satoshi’s revenge match!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.880
I’ll win my way up the ranks again!

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:16.540
The Pokémon World Championships
has approved this Super Class battle!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:21.400
The match-up is Contestant Saito
VS Contestant Satoshi.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.150
This battle will be a 2v2.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.320
Pikachu, Riolu! Stay sharp!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.620
All right, both sides send out
your Pokémon at the same time.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.750
3!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:34.730
2!

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:35.450
1!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.910
Go, Pikachu!
Go!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:37.900
Go, Pikachu!

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.290
Capoeirer!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.710
Capoeirer, huh?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:51.270
Capoeirer! Handstand Pokémon!
Fighting type!

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.130
It fights while spinning like a top!

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:57.600
The centrifugal force
boosts its destructive power by 10 times!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.060
Battle, start!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:03.220
Capoeirer! Gyro Ball!

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.610
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.690
Stand strong, Pikachu!

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:14.620
Iron Tail!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.130
They’re evenly matched.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.460
Lightning Speed!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.100
Now! Electroweb!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.840
He’s putting on pressure.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:41.190
He might be trying his good old
“fight with speed” tactic!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.110
Catch it!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.450
Now we’ve cut your speed!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:53.820
Focus Energy!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.630
Be careful, Pikachu!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:10.840
Focus Energy, huh?
That’ll make it easier for Capoeirer to hit a vital spot!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.600
Triple Kick!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.460
That hit hard!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.640
The Electroweb hit its mark,

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.530
but it’s like it did nothing.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.640
Are you okay, Pikachu?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.620
Well then, how’s this?!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.600
Use Electroweb on the arena!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:52.920
W-What?!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.260
Gyro Ball!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.150
Iron Tail!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.950
Lightning Speed!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.170
Capoeirer is unable to battle!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.550
All right! We win the first match!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.730
Good job, Pikachu!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:49.160
They won!
You did it, Satoshi, Pikachu!

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:52.560
Really excited, I see!

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:57.200
Satoshi couldn’t defeat even one of
Miss Saito’s Pokémon last time.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.240
Now if he can keep up the momentum
and beat the next...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.730
But how do you think
<i>she</i> feels about this loss?

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.920
Come back, Capoeirer.

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.170
You fought well.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.800
Go, Otosupus!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.020
Here comes Otosupus!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.300
Pocket Monsters!

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:41.530
Otosupus

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.370
Pikachu, keep it up!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.250
Lightning Speed!

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.550
Infight!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.490
100,000 Volts!

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:31.540
It withstood the hit!

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:33.330
Octolock!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.300
Iron Tail!

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.010
Pikachu!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.020
Don’t struggle!
It’ll just make it hurt more!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.990
Well then...
Use 100,000 Volts!

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.780
You can’t put in the strength?

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:14.080
Then try an Iron Tail!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:20.930
They can’t use 100,000 Volts
<i>or</i> Iron Tail...

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:23.510
That’s what makes Octolock
so terrifying.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:26.470
Its tentacles can restrain
your entire body.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.940
There’s gotta be some way...

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.320
Aqua Break!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.300
Pikachu is unable to battle!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.260
Pikachu!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.080
Thanks, Riolu.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.380
You did well, Pikachu.
Thank you.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:34.540
Cheer Riolu on, please.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.080
It’s all on you now, Riolu!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.840
I can sense its fighting spirit rising!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:51.060
Riolu has already lost
to Otosupus once.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:54.170
Its Octolock was
completely overpowering.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.390
Go, Riolu!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.360
Aqua Break!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.820
Vacuum Wave!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.370
Fall back!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:22.390
Now, there’s an interesting approach!
He blew the water from Aqua Break in its face!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:25.650
But why wouldn’t he
close in for an attack?

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:29.270
He may have deliberately changed
the rhythm of his attacks.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.720
Octolock!

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:44.350
He smiled?!

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.910
He isn’t even trying
to break free.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.170
What’s the plan, Satoshi?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:20.560
That’s it, Riolu!
Match up to Otosupus’s movements!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.740
Start breaking through
the Octolock!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.980
Most intriguing.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.690
Let me see what you have!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.030
Miss Saito’s letting him do it!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:33.950
Riolu, store up your power!

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:47.960
Force Palm!

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:54.970
We did it!

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.900
Amazing, Satoshi!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.610
Instead of fighting the Octolock,

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:07.870
he waited until the last possible moment
when Otosupus had grabbed hold,

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:10.370
and released a Force Palm
at point-blank range!

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:14.360
That way, he could escape
<i>while</i> dealing considerable damage!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:17.860
Your Force Palm has
gotten stronger.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.470
Well, then, we shall answer
in turn with our full power!

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:23.830
Infight!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.380
Let’s finish this!
Another Force Palm!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.970
Go!

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:14.010
Otosupus and Riolu
are both unable to battle!

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:18.850
As such, this battle is a draw!
No change to the rankings!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:20.830
A draw...

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:25.120
That was a great battle!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.450
Well done,
trainers and Pokémon alike!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:31.570
All right, let’s take a break.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.860
All of this?! Awesome!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:43.390
My energy comes from
these truly delicious sweets!

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:47.370
Eat sweets to build stamina!
I have ones for Pokémon as well!

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.710
There’s a shocker...

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.100
I can eat whatever I want?

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:54.280
Of course! You showed me
a most heated battle, after all!

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.630
So help yourself!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.770
Don’t mind if I do!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:09.230
Ma’am, I suppose this
might not suit your tastes...

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.570
It’s delicious, Mr. Shijima.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.950
There’s a second shocker...

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.200
Very good, very good indeed!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.120
You like sweet stuff?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.880
I love it!

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:39.470
Here.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.540
Delicious!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.560
Do you want some, too, Riolu?

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:00.270
Here.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.580
Good for you, Pikachu, Riolu.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.840
The way you broke free
from Octolock was remarkable.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:18.140
But I guess it won’t be easy
to beat you.

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.840
I gotta train more.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.100
I will move on to the Hyper Class.

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:25.350
I won’t lose, either!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.840
Just as I thought!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:34.170
That attitude of acknowledging her foe
yet striving to rise above them comes from her father!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.380
Her father?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:40.130
A long time ago, I learned Galar Karate
in the Galar Region.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.770
She was the beloved daughter
of a teacher there.

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.540
I see.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:49.750
Even back then, she possessed
considerable talent for Galar Karate.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:53.920
It’s only natural,
since I’m aiming to be the strongest.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:04.390
Whatever the case, I will defeat Mr. Dande
to become the true strongest!

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:07.640
<i>I</i> will battle Mr. Dande first!

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.470
We will both ascend to greater heights,
aiming for Mr. Dande.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:13.650
Yeah! Even greater heights!

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:17.960
I see. You both share the same goal.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.400
I look forward to your coming battles.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:24.850
Which one of you will bring down
the invincible Dande?

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:26.280
I can’t wait to see!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.790
We will battle again,
trainer of Riolu.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.920
I’m Satoshi!

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.510
A draw, huh?

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:45.090
Too bad.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.320
I’ll win next time!

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.230
I’ll be rooting for you!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.400
Thank you!

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:57.520
Pikachu, Riolu.
Let’s give it our all!

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:03.150
By the way, Go,
what did you catch in Johto?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.550
I’m glad you asked.

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.570
Come out!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.700
Oh, a Chonchie?

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.630
Catching it was a real pain...

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.590
Still not done?

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:23.880
Nope!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.590
I won’t go home until I’ve caught
<i>at least</i> one Johto Pokémon!

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:33.480
I got it in the end, so it’s fine!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:37.440
Satoshi has faced another challenge
in his second battle with Saito.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:42.420
His challenge to reach the mightiest Champion,
Dande, will continue.

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.770
Mew!

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:52.520
Warrgle!

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.310
Runpappa!

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.080
Pawou!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:54.820
Ulgamoth!

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:55.610
Strike!

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:56.410
Cresselia!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.120
Amakaji!

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:57.930
Jirachi!

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:58.730
Chobomaki!

00:21:58.730 --> 00:21:59.500
Kibago!

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.270
Gonbe!

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:01.050
Bayleaf!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:02.550
Freezer!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.740
Zacian!

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:20.590
Mew!

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:21.420
Wooper!

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:22.140
Pachirisu!

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:22.990
Sunaba!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:23.650
Absol!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.510
Lunala!

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.320
Rabbifoot!

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.100
Tropius!

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:26.870
Sunahebi!

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:27.740
Vibrava!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:28.390
Burshamo!

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:29.160
Mokuroh!

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:29.980
Rotom!

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:30.700
Mooland!

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:31.480
Dodorio!

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:32.200
Otosupus!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.020
Swanna!

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:33.770
Nazonokusa!

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:34.590
Samehada!

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:35.360
Darkrai!

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.040
Iwanko!

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:36.870
Cortoise!

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:37.700
Scorupi!

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:38.480
Pippi!

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:39.200
Pinpuku!

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:39.980
Kunugidama!

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:40.720
Mankey!

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:41.530
Kimori!

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:42.350
Ligray!

00:22:42.350 --> 00:22:43.780
Rayquaza!

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:44.510
Zamazenta!

00:23:07.260 --> 00:23:09.680
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:11.160
Go!

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:14.530
Listen up! We detected
strong biological energy!

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:17.120
This proves a rare Pokémon
has appeared!

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:19.350
A rare Pokémon?!

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:21.050
A massive thundercloud...

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:22.850
Strong biological energy...

00:23:22.850 --> 00:23:24.590
A rare Pokémon...

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:27.580
Thunder is coming!

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:29.470
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:33.060
A Legendary Raid Battle!!
VS Thunder!
VS Thunder!
A Legendary Raid Battle!!

00:23:33.060 --> 00:23:35.470
VS Thunder!
A Legendary Raid Battle!!
